@startuml

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "Joining Node (Node J)" as J
participant "Seed Node (Node S)" as S

J -> S: JOIN_REQUEST(node_id, host, port)
S --> J: PEER_LIST(peers)
J -> J: initialize peer table from received list

note over J,S
Bootstrap provides initial connectivity knowledge.
Subsequent convergence is handled by heartbeat and gossip cycles.
end note

@enduml
